<http://digistrucmed.org/ClinicalValue> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "ClinicalValue" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/LevelOfEvidence_C-EO> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "C-EO" .
<http://digistrucmed.org/FormEntity> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Form Entity" .
